      "title": "Dividend of ₹2.50 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹2.50. Ex-date: 13th February 2026 Payment date: 8th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.7%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by earnings (25% earnings payout ratio) but not covered by cash flows (418% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 44% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 92% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
